    <briefdescription>
<para>Weight entry for a single named LoRA adapter layer. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Stores the low-rank matrices B and A along with the layer&apos;s hyperparameters. The effective weight delta is: ΔW = (B @ A) × scaling, where scaling = alpha / rank</para>
<para>Dimensions: B: (in_dim × rank) – down-projection A: (rank × out_dim) – up-projection </para>
    </detaileddescription>
